<title>USA: Spiegel Eddie Bauer December sales up.</title>
<headline>Spiegel Eddie Bauer December sales up.</headline>
<dateline>DOWNERS GROVE, Ill. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spiegel Inc said Thursday that its Eddie Bauer unit's same store sales rose four percent for the five week period ended December 28.</p>
<p>Same store sales for Eddie Bauer for the 52-week period ended December 28 were flat.</p>
<p>Spiegel said its total sales for the five-week period were $527.6 million, up four percent from $508.7 million a year ago.</p>
<p>For the 52-week period, total Spiegel sales were $2.85 billion, down from $2.89 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
